Hello to All

I have an IMX6 board and I need a simple way to capture/put an I2s master
signal
I'm working with yocto and kernel version 3.14.28-1.0.0
I have on my development board an sgtl5000 codec but it work only with I2S
slave mode

I've found the driver fsl-asoc-card.c from more recent kernel and I've
modified it

But no matter what I do i cannot set I2S to master mode

Please Help



